## Definitions

**"noncommercial purpose" means any purpose other than (a) selling the
software or services related to the software, (b) selling or providing
services that use the software, or (c) distributing the software as part
of a product or service whose primary value comes from the software.**

**"the licensor" means the individual or entity offering these terms, and
